    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there is no \"more\" for me. everyone in my department expects me to be this brilliant researcher, and now i'm just a fraud. i've already lost the respect of my peers and my advisor. it feels like there's no way to go back to who i was, and the person i am now is just... a failure. it feels like i'm just taking up space that belongs to someone who actually succeeds. it just feels like everything is done.",
